{
  "id": "i02-l04",
  "unit": "i02-and-then",
  "title": "Without eating",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**না** + participle = **without** doing: **না খেয়ে** 'without eating', **না বলে** 'without telling', **না জেনে** 'without knowing'.\n\n**সে না খেয়ে স্কুলে গেল** 'He went to school without eating.'\n\nHere **না** comes **before** the participle. With a normal verb it comes after: **খাই না** 'I don't eat'. Never say খেয়ে না for 'without eating'.\n\n**নিয়ে** 'taking (along)': **ছাতা নিয়ে বাইরে গেলাম** 'I went out with an umbrella.'\n\n**চলে গেলাম** 'I left' (lit. went away); **চলে গেল** 'he left'.",
  "vocab": [
